{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01384",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.12,
      "end_seconds": 7.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Okay, so hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.58,
      "end_seconds": 11.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.54,
      "end_seconds": 21.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Hello, um, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.21,
      "end_seconds": 27.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 27.83,
      "end_seconds": 34.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Hmm, doctor, it's a sore ankle. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.05,
      "end_seconds": 38.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.07,
      "end_seconds": 48.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Let me think, uh, around three days, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 52.12,
      "end_seconds": 57.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Ah, um, hm, I'd say more like five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.3,
      "end_seconds": 63.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to five days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.48,
      "end_seconds": 67.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Okay, so that sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.78,
      "end_seconds": 78.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.39,
      "end_seconds": 87.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "It settles a little with ice. It's worse with walking. Honestly, on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.25,
      "end_seconds": 96.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "Um, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 96.46,
      "end_seconds": 102.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.87,
      "end_seconds": 106.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Actually, I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 111.45,
      "end_seconds": 114.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.82,
      "end_seconds": 127.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any pain in the foot, numbness or crack or pop?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.81,
      "end_seconds": 147.59,
      "duration_seconds": 15.78,
      "text": "Oh, no, no pain in the foot, no numbness, no crack or pop. I did have a little swelling at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.07,
      "end_seconds": 154.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.53,
      "end_seconds": 158.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.14,
      "end_seconds": 161.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.31,
      "end_seconds": 168.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Diclofenac, 50 milligrams, maybe, when needed for the joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.93,
      "end_seconds": 174.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.24,
      "end_seconds": 190.29,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "Hmm, not with me. I'll bring it next time. Um, I take ibuprofen gel, three times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.98,
      "end_seconds": 192.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.31,
      "end_seconds": 199.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.44,
      "end_seconds": 218.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.71,
      "end_seconds": 229.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.5,
      "text": "Let me think, my father had bowel cancer. My mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.78,
      "end_seconds": 233.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.58,
      "end_seconds": 252.06,
      "duration_seconds": 14.48,
      "text": "Hmm, uh, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.53,
      "end_seconds": 266.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.8,
      "end_seconds": 272.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Um, um, no, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.39,
      "end_seconds": 275.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.35,
      "end_seconds": 282.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "Arthritis in my knees, for about ten years. Yes, thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.22,
      "end_seconds": 288.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.64,
      "end_seconds": 296.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Okay, I can see arthritis in your knees in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 300.76,
      "end_seconds": 308.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temperature 36.8, respiratory rate 15, pulse 82, pressure 111 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.36,
      "end_seconds": 310.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.61,
      "end_seconds": 317.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.89,
      "end_seconds": 319.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.91,
      "end_seconds": 322.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.2,
      "end_seconds": 341.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "There's mild swelling over the outside of the ankle, and you can put your weight on it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.74,
      "end_seconds": 343.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.54,
      "end_seconds": 378.51,
      "duration_seconds": 31.97,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Okay, thinking it through, it fits best with a mild ankle sprain. I'd also keep a minor fracture in mind. Rest, ice, a compression bandage and keep it raised for two days. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Do get help quickly if you cannot put weight on it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.97,
      "end_seconds": 381.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.08,
      "end_seconds": 384.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.46,
      "end_seconds": 391.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}